# Explicit path budget: dist/** <= 5 MiB; src/** <= 512 KiB;
# scripts/** + artifacts/** + documentation <= 512 KiB. Total additions <= 8 MiB.
# public/FONT-LICENSE.txt <= 8 KiB (font attribution, also included in dist budget).
# Deliver the bounded validation record and screenshots even if globally ignored.
!artifacts/
!artifacts/**
# Dependencies, caches, and scratch checks are never deliverables, at any depth.
**/node_modules/
**/.vite/
**/.cache/
**/.npm/
**/.playwright-mcp/
test/scratch/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
